OL,3,GNEWSAI gave birth in ambulance on A96
OL,4,Aamid staff shortages at local hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman gave birth in the back of a
OL,7,Fmoving ambulance after being told the
OL,8,Fspecialist care she might need was
OL,9,Funavailable at her local hospital.
OL,11,FHannah Smith, 39, lives less than 20
OL,12,Fmiles from Dr Gray's Hospital in Elgin
OL,13,Fbut it has only accepted low risk
OL,14,Fpregnancies since services were
OL,15,Fdowngraded in 2018.
OL,17,FInstead she was sent to Aberdeen
OL,18,FMaternity Hospital - 60 miles away from
OL,19,Fher Moray home - but her labour
OL,20,Fprogressed so quickly her baby boy
OL,21,FBraeson arrived before she could get
OL,22,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
