OL,3,GNEWSAI gave birth in ambulance on A96
OL,4,Aamid staff shortages at local hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I don't think anyone should be put
OL,7,Finto that position," she said. NHS
OL,8,FGrampian said it was sorry about the
OL,9,F"poor experience".
